# Idea Parking Lot

Purpose: capture new product, agent, SaaS, marketplace, nonprofit, or platform
ideas without letting them interrupt the 30-day revenue push.

## Rule

Ideas are allowed. New builds are not.

For the next 30 days, any new idea goes here as a one-line entry. No folder, no
spec, no code, no research session, no domain buying, no new stack.

## Current Primary Focus

```text
NorthStar Inbox Shield cashflow path:
use the working LangGraph / Grok / eval-harness demo to win one small paid
freelance contract within 30 days.
```

## Active Exceptions

Only these are allowed during the 30-day window:

1. Paid client work.
2. Inbox Shield proposal/demo support.
3. Tiny fixes needed to keep the demo proof passing.
4. Scheduled review of this file.

## Monthly Review Rule

Review this file once per month. An idea can move out only if:

- It still feels useful after 30 days.
- It supports NorthStar, Social Architect, or SwarmCommand directly.
- It has a clear customer/funding path.
- It does not create a new build before revenue.

